    {
        "content": "<p>just got a good base setup for helix if someone is looking for it:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"TOML\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">use-grammars</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">only</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">\"roc\"</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">[language-server.roc-lsp]</span>\n<span class=\"n\">command</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"roc\"</span>\n<span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">\"experimental-lsp\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"--stdio\"</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">[[language]]</span>\n<span class=\"n\">name</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"roc\"</span>\n<span class=\"n\">scope</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"source.roc\"</span>\n<span class=\"n\">injection-regex</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"roc\"</span>\n<span class=\"n\">file-types</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">\"roc\"</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n<span class=\"n\">shebangs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">\"roc\"</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n<span class=\"n\">roots</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[]</span>\n<span class=\"n\">comment-token</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"#\"</span>\n<span class=\"n\">language-servers</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">\"roc-lsp\"</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n<span class=\"n\">indent</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tab-width</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">unit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"    \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"n\">formatter</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">command</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"roc\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">\"fmt\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"--stdin\"</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"n\">auto-format</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kc\">true</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">[language.auto-pairs]</span>\n<span class=\"s1\">'('</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">')'</span>\n<span class=\"s1\">'{'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">'}'</span>\n<span class=\"s1\">'['</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">']'</span>\n<span class=\"s1\">'\"'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">'\"'</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">[[grammar]]</span>\n<span class=\"n\">name</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"roc\"</span>\n<span class=\"n\">source</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">git</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"https://github.com/faldor20/tree-sitter-roc.git\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rev</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"master\"</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
